; SandboxAI overlay of examples/VirtualCamera/VirtualCamera.tscn
; (upstream: https://github.com/edbeeching/godot_rl_agents_examples @ d659636)
; Only change: SubViewport size 36x36 -> 84x84, the initial observation
; resolution for feasibility Test C (pixel throughput on the RTX 4060 Ti).
; The observation shape reported to Python becomes [3, 84, 84] (RGB, no alpha
; because transparent_bg is off on the SubViewport).

